polyglot  [Node.js, Docker, Kubernetes, Kafka, EF Core]

  pnpm run dev                        Run dev in web, then run api project  ∞ long-running
  pnpm run k8s:apply                  Apply Kubernetes resources  [external]
  pnpm run test                       Run test in all workspace packages
  pnpm run lint                       Run lint in all workspace packages
  pnpm run typecheck                  Run typecheck in all workspace packages
  pnpm run migrate                    Apply EF Core migrations to database
  pnpm run services                   Start Docker services in background
  pnpm run kafka:topics               List Kafka topics  [external]
  pnpm run kafka:reset                Delete Kafka topics  [destructive]
  pnpm run k8s:render                 Render Kustomize manifests from k8s
  pnpm run reset                      Stop Docker services and delete their volumes (+2 more steps)  [destructive]
  docker compose -f … up -d postgres  Start PostgreSQL
  docker compose -f … up -d kafka     Start local Kafka broker
  docker compose -f … logs -f         Follow Docker service logs  ∞ long-running
  docker compose -f … down            Stop and remove Docker services
  docker compose -f … down -v         Stop Docker services and delete their volumes  [destructive]
  kubectl delete -k k8s               Delete resources from cluster  [destructive]
  ./scripts/setup.sh                  Bootstrap fresh development machine

apps/api  [.NET]
  dotnet run                 Start .NET Api web app
  dotnet watch run           Start Api with hot reload  ∞ long-running
  dotnet build               Build Api project
  dotnet publish -c Release  Publish Api for deployment

apps/api.tests  [.NET]
  dotnet test  Run Api.Tests tests

apps/web  [Node.js, Vite, Vitest, Playwright]
  pnpm run dev        Start Vite development server  ∞ long-running
  pnpm run build      Build app with Vite
  pnpm run test       Run Vitest tests
  pnpm run test:e2e   Run Playwright end-to-end tests
  pnpm run lint       Check source code with ESLint
  pnpm run typecheck  Check TypeScript types

packages/ui  [Node.js, Vitest]
  pnpm run build  Build package with tsup
  pnpm run test   Run Vitest tests
  pnpm run lint   Check source code with ESLint

services/worker  [Go]
  go run .        Run Go worker program
  go build ./...
  go test ./...   Run Go tests
  go vet ./...    Check Go source with go vet
  go fmt ./...    Format Go source
  go mod tidy     Tidy Go module dependencies  ↓ download
